# Declared exemptions for the instrumented-stamps-resolve check.
#
# Format: <repo-relative path> | <entry text> | <reason>
#   path   — the file carrying the stamp, relative to the repo root
#   entry  — the full `- <stamp> <pointer>` line, trimmed
#   reason — why this stamp asserts no real claim. Mandatory. An entry
#            matching no violation is STALE and fails the check.
#
# The sites below are claims-registry fixtures: the stamps exercise the
# `claims`/`assumes` collectors and the key-collision rules — they are the
# vocabulary's own test corpus, not assertions about shipped behavior.

